        "text": "Linux distributions \u2013 a practical guide\nThe following use cases are inspired by real-world problems, taken mostly from the authors\u2019 own\nexperience in the system administration and software engineering field. Each of these scenarios\npresents the challenge of choosing the right Linux distribution for the job.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Case study \u2013 development workstation\n\u2022 Case study \u2013 secure web server\n\u2022 Use case \u2013 personal blog\n\u2022 Use case \u2013 media server\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
